        {
          "textRaw": "TimedTask",
          "name": "timedtask",
          "desc": "<p>由定时任务创建和查询方法返回的 Java 对象. 常用属性包括:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>id</code>, <code>millis</code>, <code>scriptPath</code>, <code>timeFlag</code>.</li>\n<li><code>delay</code>, <code>interval</code>, <code>loopTimes</code>.</li>\n<li><code>repeatMode</code>, <code>endMode</code>, <code>endValue</code>, <code>finishedTimes</code>.</li>\n<li><code>dayOfMonth</code>, <code>monthOfYear</code>, <code>scheduled</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>常用方法包括 <code>getNextTime()</code>, <code>isDisposable()</code>, <code>isDaily()</code>, <code>isWeekly()</code>, <code>isMonthly()</code>, <code>isYearly()</code> 和 <code>isCountdown()</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "TimedTask"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "IntentTask",
          "name": "intenttask",
          "desc": "<p>由广播任务创建和查询方法返回的 Java 对象. 常用属性包括 <code>id</code>, <code>scriptPath</code>, <code>action</code>, <code>category</code>, <code>dataType</code> 和 <code>local</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "IntentTask"
        }
      ],
      "type": "module",
      "displayName": "任务 (Tasks)"
    }
